ze: 1.2rem;\n        }\n        h1{\n            margin: 2rem;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n        }\n        p{\n            font-size: 1rem;\n        }\n    <\/style>\n\n\n    <h1>CERTIFIED FOOT HEALTH BENIFITS<\/h1>\n    <p>The American Podiatric Medical Association (APMA) is the leading resource for foot health information, representing 15,000 podiatrists across the United States. Many Vionic products carry the APMA Seal of Acceptance, which certifies that they are beneficial in promoting foot health. Vionic is one of the few footwear brands with demonstrated ability to provide proper support.<\/p>\n    <div id=\"moreText\">\n        <p>In order to earn the Seal of Acceptance, each product is reviewed by a group of APMA podiatrists to ensure its safety and<\/p>\n        <p>overall quality, as well as its effectiveness.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <button id=\"readMoreBtn\" onclick=\"toggleText()\">Read More<\/button>\n\n    <script>\n        function toggleText() {\n            const moreText = document.getElementById(\"moreText\");\n            const btn = document.getElementById(\"readMoreBtn\");\n\n            if (moreText.style.display === \"none\") {\n                moreText.style.display = \"block\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read Less\";\n            } else {\n                moreText.style.display = \"none\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read More\";\n            }\n        }\n    <\/script>\n\n<\/body>","setwidth":"full","padding":false,"col_center":false,"bgsection":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","rangebg":0,"bgbefore":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","e_size":"auto","e_repeat":"no-repeat"}},"advanced_content_frCRJb":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"html_CLVeYw":{"type":"html","settings":{"code":"","width":"100%","align":"auto"}}},"block_order":["html_CLVeYw"],"disabled":true,"name":"Custom HTML","settings":{"animation":"","paddingsection":"0px 0px 30px 0px","paddingmobile":"0px 0px 30px 0px","marginsection":"0px 0px 0px 0px","marginmobile":"0px 0px 0px 0px","zindex":"0","title_top":"","title":"","des":"<body>\n\n\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Vionic - Comfortable Shoes for Women<\/title>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <style>\n    body { \n      line-height: 1.5; \n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; \n      padding: 1rem; \n    }\n    h1 { margin: 2rem 0 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }\n    h2 { margin: 1.5rem 0 .75rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }\n    p { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n\n    .is-hidden { display: none; }\n\n    \/* Modern button styling *\/\n    #toggleContentBtn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background-color: #000;      \/* Black button *\/\n      color: #fff;                 \/* White text *\/\n      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 25px;         \/* Rounded pill shape *\/\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    #toggleContentBtn:hover {\n      background-color: #444;      \/* Dark gray on hover *\/\n      transform: translateY(-2px); \/* Slight lift effect *\/\n    }\n    #toggleContentBtn:active {\n      transform: translateY(0);    \/* Reset on click *\/\n    }\n  <\/style>\n\n\n\n  <h1>DISCOVER VIONIC’S APMA-ACCEPTED SHOES<\/h1>\n  <p>\n    At Vionic, we take pride in offering a collection of APMA shoes that meet the standards set by\n    the American Podiatric Medical Association's committee of experts. Carefully evaluated and\n    granted the prestigious Seal of Acceptance, these shoes are thoughtfully designed to support a\n    variety of foot types, including high and low arches, while ensuring both comfort and style.\n  <\/p>\n\n  <div id=\"moreText\" class=\"is-hidden\">\n    <p>\n      Whether you’re looking for casual options, active footwear, or professional styles, our\n      collection has something for everyone. Each pair is meticulously crafted to align with your\n      lifestyle needs, making them ideal for walking, working, and everyday activities. Discover\n      APMA-accepted men’s and women’s shoes—from versatile sneakers to polished flats—each awarded\n      the APMA Seal of Acceptance for promoting good foot health.\n    <\/p>\n\n    <h2>WHY APMA ACCEPTANCE MATTERS<\/h2>\n    <p>\n      The APMA Seal of Acceptance is awarded to footwear that has been rigorously reviewed and meets\n      the criteria for promoting good foot health. Vionic’s shoes, including our popular walking\n      sneakers and supportive sandals, are engineered with foot health in mind.\n    <\/p>\n    <p>\n      The Seal isn’t just a label—it’s a mark of quality. These shoes are a smart choice for anyone\n      seeking comfort and support without compromising on style. Whether you need walking sneakers\n      for women, women’s sandals, or men’s boots, the APMA Seal ensures you’re choosing footwear you\n      can trust.\n    <\/p>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <button id=\"toggleContentBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"moreText\">\n    Read More\n  <\/button>\n\n  <script>\n    const moreText = document.getElementById(\"moreText\");\n    const btn = document.getElementById(\"toggleContentBtn\");\n\n    function toggleText() {\n      const isHidden = moreText.classList.toggle(\"is-hidden\");\n      btn.textContent = isHidden ? \"Read More\" : \"Read Less\";\n      btn.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", String(!isHidden));\n    }\n\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", toggleText);\n  <\/script>\n\n\n<\/body>","setwidth":"full","padding":false,"col_center":false,"bgsection":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","rangebg":0,"bgbefore":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","e_size":"auto","e_repeat":"no-repeat"}},"grid_banner_riTkEz":{"type":"grid-banner","blocks":{"banner_yMfemg":{"type":"banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/VioMotion_Footer_-_Product_Listing.jpg","width":"12","description":"","bg_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","colordef":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","opacity_bg":0,"st